WhetherDateOfAGMOrEGMOrPostalBallotOrOtherIsFixed><in-capmkt:ReasonsForDateOfAGMOrEGMOrPostalBallotOrOtherIsNotFixed contextRef="MainI">Date of EGM once finalised will be intimated to stock exchanges as per SEBI LODR Regulations, 2015</in-capmkt:ReasonsForDateOfAGMOrEGMOrPostalBallotOrOtherIsNotFixed><in-capmkt:WhetherRecordOrBookClosureDateFixedByTheCompany contextRef="MainD">false</in-capmkt:WhetherRecordOrBookClosureDateFixedByTheCompany><in-capmkt:ReasonsForRecordOrBookClosureDateIsNotFixedByTheCompany contextRef="MainI">Since the EGM will be scheduled for Fund raising, record date is not applicable. Relevant date shall be fixed as per SEBI ICDR Regulations</in-capmkt:ReasonsForRecordOrBookClosureDateIsNotFixedByTheCompany><in-capmkt:WhetherRelevantDateIsSetAsPerTheProvisionOfSEBIICDRRegulationsForDeterminingFloorPrice contextRef="MainD">true</in-capmkt:WhetherRelevantDateIsSetAsPerTheProvisionOfSEBIICDRRegulationsForDeterminingFloorPrice><in-capmkt:WhetherTheBoardDecidedTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised contextRef="MainD">false</in-capmkt:WhetherTheBoardDecidedTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised><in-capmkt:ReasonsForBoardDidNotDecideTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised contextRef="MainI">The Board has approved raising of capital through a Qualified Institutions Placement by the issue of equity shares of face value of Re. 1 each and Preferential issue of warrants convertible into equivalent number of Equity Shares. However the number of securities to be issued shall be determined post shareholders approval.</in-capmkt:ReasonsForBoardDidNotDecideTheModeThroughWhichFundShallBeRaised><in-capmkt:RemarksWebsiteDisseminationForIssuanceOfSecurities contextRef="MainI">The Board of Directors, at its meeting held today, i.e., 1 October 2026, inter alia, has approved, the following proposals, subject to such regulatory, statutory approvals as may be required, including approval of the shareholders of the Company &lt;BR&gt; 
1. Raising of capital through a Qualified Institutions Placement for an aggregate amount not exceeding Rs. 11,700 Crore &lt;BR&gt; 
2. Preferential issue of warrants convertible into equivalent number of Equity Shares for an aggregate amount not exceeding Rs. 5,800 Crore</in-capmkt:RemarksWebsiteDisseminationForIssuanceOfSecurities></xbrli:xbrl>
